  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "MindSee",
      "text": "[English](README.md) · [中文](README.zh-CN.md)\n\nDeepSeek cannot see pictures. MindSee gives it a way to look.\n\nPaste a screenshot into the composer, or point at a JPEG, PNG, or WebP on your machine. The image is described through [MindSee](https://mindsee.app); DeepSeek answers from that description. You stay on the same model—there is no need to switch to a vision model."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "You will need [DeepSeek Harness](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness) and the web profile.\n\n```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web add dsh-mindsee\n```\n\nRestart `dsh web` when it finishes."
    },
    {
      "section": "Connect your token",
      "text": "1. Create an access token at [mindsee.app](https://mindsee.app).\n2. In DeepSeek Harness, open **Settings → Plugins → MindSee**.\n3. Paste the token and save."
    },
    {
      "section": "Ask with a picture",
      "text": "Paste an image into the composer and write your question in the same message. JPEG, PNG, and WebP are supported, up to 20 MB.\n\nA local file path works just as well, if you would rather type than paste."
    },
    {
      "section": "MindSee",
      "text": "[English](README.md) · [中文](README.zh-CN.md)\n\nDeepSeek 看不见图。MindSee 替它看。\n\n把截图贴进输入框，或指向本地的 JPEG、PNG、WebP。画面经 [MindSee](https://mindsee.app) 转成文字，DeepSeek 据此作答。模型不用换，也不必改用视觉接口。"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "需要已安装 [DeepSeek Harness](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness)，并使用 web 配置。\n\n```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web add dsh-mindsee\n```\n\n装完后重启 `dsh web`。"
    },
    {
      "section": "接入令牌",
      "text": "1. 在 [mindsee.app](https://mindsee.app) 创建访问令牌。\n2. 打开 DeepSeek Harness 的 **设置 → 插件 → MindSee**。\n3. 填入令牌并保存。"
    },
    {
      "section": "带着图提问",
      "text": "在输入框里贴图，同一条消息里把问题写上。支持 JPEG、PNG、WebP，单张不超过 20 MB。\n\n也可以直接给出本地文件路径。"
    }
  ],
